    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic conceptual visual representing the India-US trade deal. Two abstract hands, one subtly adorned with Indian design elements and the other with American motifs, clasping firmly in a handshake. Above them, a vibrant, upward-trending economic graph with green arrows, symbolizing growth and market rebound. In the background, hints of turbulent, stormy clouds (representing global geopolitical shocks) are visibly receding or being pushed back by a clear, rising sun over a stylized map outlining India and the US. The overall composition should convey optimism, stability, and a powerful bilateral connection amidst global challenges. Use a clean, modern aesthetic with a palette emphasizing blues, greens, and gold.",
