    featuredImagePrompt: "A futuristic, wide-angle realistic environment depicting SpaceX's Terafab facility on Earth, showing massive, sleek Starships being assembled under advanced gantry systems, with plumes of clean-burning natural gas exhaust faintly visible. In the background, subtly blend in a Martian landscape with early human habitats and a Starship landing, creating a seamless visual transition from terrestrial manufacturing to interplanetary colonization. The sky should hint at both Earth's blue and Mars' reddish hues. Emphasize scale, innovation, and the ambitious link between Earth-based production and future Martian life. Ensure a clean, professional, and awe-inspiring aesthetic suitable for a news article.",
