    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a dynamic composition. In the foreground, stylized medical illustrations subtly blend: a healthy joint with regenerating cartilage, a shrinking pancreatic tumor, and a repaired kidney. These elements are interwoven with glowing abstract light streams representing scientific progress and hope. The background features a blurred, global map overlay, suggesting worldwide impact, with faint silhouettes of researchers at work. The color palette is optimistic, using blues, greens, and subtle golds. The layout should have a sense of urgency and breakthrough, typical of a major news announcement, with a prominent 'BREAKTHROUGH' banner subtly integrated.",
