      potentialCatalysts: ["Successful diplomatic resolution between Iran and Oman, leading to de-escalation.", "Stronger-than-expected corporate earnings reports and positive forward guidance.", "Stabilization or decrease in global energy prices.", "Central bank signals of a more accommodative monetary policy."],
