        ["Biotech & Pharma", "₹3.0 Lakh Cr", "12-16%", "Healthcare Demand, R&D Investment, Biosecurity Focus"],
        ["Advanced Manufacturing", "₹2.5 Lakh Cr", "10-14%", "Supply Chain Resilience, Automation, \'Make in India\'"]
